{"id":"fruto","lemma":"fruto","pos":"noun","rank":4556,"glosses":["any fruit from a plant, whether sweet or not (like avocado or tomato), edible or not","any vegetable or produce that is grown","profit from an activity"],"ipa":"/ˈfɾuto/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"frutos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/93/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodrigo5260-fruto.wav","examples":[{"text":"El negocio no dio frutos.","en":"The business didn't produce a profit.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"business, enterprise"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null]},{"text":"Aquel esfuerzo no dio fruto.","en":"That effort bore no fruit.","words":[{"g":"that (over there"},{"g":"effort, endeavor"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null]},{"text":"Por su fruto se conoce al árbol.","en":"A tree is known by its fruit.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590180","words":[{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to know","l":"conocer"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"tree"}]},{"text":"Su esfuerzo dará fruto.","en":"His effort will bear fruit.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"effort, endeavor"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null]},{"text":"La persistencia dará sus frutos.","en":"Persistence will pay off.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/804360","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"persistence"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]}]}